#: ../../user/plugin-notification.md:3
#, python-format
msgid ""
"ReScript bindings for the [Tauri 2.x notification "
"plugin](https://v2.tauri.app/plugin/notification/) — toast notifications,"
" scheduling, channels, and tap-action types. The 100% stable public "
"surface of `@tauri-apps/plugin-notification` v2.3.x is covered."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user/plugin-notification.md:11
msgid ""
"The Phase 2 implementation of this package is feature-complete in `main`."
" Its first npm publish is scheduled alongside the other Phase 2 packages."
" Until then, consume it via the source repository or a workspace link."
msgstr ""

